        "EnableTitleDoubleLine": false,
        "DescPicture": "",
        "PreviewDesc": {
          "Namespace": "ActivityCommonDisplay",
          "Key": "10022_PreviewDesc",
          "SourceString": "<FirstTopUp_RulesContent_16M>首次完成任意金额付费，可解锁额外礼包！</>\n<FirstTopUp_RulesContent_16M>首充礼包内含有可解锁任意一名超弦体的【超弦体自选邀请函】以及星绘时装【夏夜之梦】等好礼！</>",
          "LocalizedString": "<FirstTopUp_RulesContent_16M>Make your first purchase of any amount to unlock an extra Gift Pack!</>\n<FirstTopUp_RulesContent_16M>The Starter Pack includes a [Superstring Invitation] to unlock any Superstring Agents and also features the [Celestia - Summer Dream] outfit, plus more great items!</>"
        },
