          "Namespace": "ActivityCommonDisplay",
          "Key": "10115_PreviewDesc",
          "SourceString": "<FunPark_Content>“久等啦！这是我们的游乐园门票~”</>\n<FunPark_Content>“好耶！但，为什么是三张？买二送一？”</>\n<FunPark_Content>“这张多出来的门票……欸，有了！”</>",
          "LocalizedString": "<FunPark_Content>\"Thanks for waiting! Here's our tickets~\"</>\n<FunPark_Content> \"Awesome! But, why are there three? Was it a buy-two-get-one-free deal?\"</>\n<FunPark_Content>\"Hmm... This extra ticket... Oh, I've got an idea!\"</>"
